"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5131600","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3946880-1846651706694814","game_id":"steam-3946880","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Crab! 🦀","summary":"🦀 Meet the Crab!Surviving on your island is about to get a little more interesting.I'm working on a new enemy system for Survindust, featuring different enemy types and new ways to deal with them.⚔️ Fight — Defeat your enemies and collect their loot.⛓️ Capture — Spare them and put them to work instead.First up is the Crab! This is just the beginning, with more enemy types to come.Community You can also join the Discord for news, updates, and small previews: Join here: https://discord.gg/jnDhCFmN","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:14:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946880-1845383656389939","game_id":"steam-3946880","kind":"announcement","title":"Multilingual Support is Now Available!","summary":"Multilingual Support is now available in the Demo!The demo now supports multiple languages, with more improvements and translations coming as development continues.Switch your language, jump back in, and enjoy the game!Thank you for playing and supporting the development!CommunityYou can also join the Discord for news, updates, and small previews:Join here: https://discord.gg/jnDhCFmNKfThanks for following along and for your support.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T20:34:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389939","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946880-1842846814447890","game_id":"steam-3946880","kind":"announcement","title":"Survindust Demo Releases on September 8th!","summary":"Survindust Demo is ReadyHey everyone!The release date for the upcoming Survindust playable demo is officially set. The demo will launch on Steam on September 8th.This upcoming demo features foundational gameplay systems, including:Island Expansion: Claim space and expand your territory outward.Crafting & Research: Gather materials, unlock essential technologies, and craft tools to sustain your progress.Resource Management: Balance your supplies and manage core survival elements to keep things ru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T21:38:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946880-1836506165545804","game_id":"steam-3946880","kind":"update","title":"Survindust – Demo Update","summary":"Survindust – Demo UpdateHello everyone! It’s been a while since my last update. I’ve been focusing on improving the core gameplay and overall experience.Demo Progress The demo is coming, but I want to make sure it feels good and fun before releasing it. It’s important that the first playable version matches the direction I’m aiming for.Support & Wishlist If you’re interested in the project, adding the game to your wishlist is a great way to support it and stay updated on future releases.Communit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T12:28:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165545804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946880-1829528821307035","game_id":"steam-3946880","kind":"update","title":"Survindust: Development Update & Demo News!","summary":"Hi everyone! I’ve been working hard on Survindust, focusing on evolving the gameplay and making the core mechanics as stable as possible. The game is taking shape exactly how I envisioned it, and I’m making sure every detail feels right. The big news: A Demo is coming! I’m currently polishing the first playable version to give you a true taste of this survival experience. My priority is quality; I want to make sure everything is rock-solid and fun before I hit that 'release' button for the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T15:11:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821307035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3946880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3946880":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3946880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z"},"5131600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:41Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3946880","app_id":3946880,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"314098f486b6a25b6b1033fe1ce1da30e7d3459b04ac13f70d9f34ad6a8eb272","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"작은 섬에 고립된 당신은 타일을 하나씩 만들